\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Holy Spirit, pity me,
\par Pierced with grief for grieving Thee;
\par Present, though I mourn apart,
\par Listen to a wailing heart.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Sins unnumbered I confess,
\par Of exceeding sinfulness;
\par Sins against Thyself alone,
\par Only to Omniscience known:
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Deafness to Thy whispered calls,
\par Rashness midst remembered falls,
\par Transient fears beneath the rod,
\par Treacherous trifling with my God;
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Tasting that the Lord is good,
\par Pining then for poisoned food;
\par At the foundations of the skies
\par Craving creaturely supplies;
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Worldly cares at worship-time;
\par Grovelling aims in works sublime;
\par Pride, when God is passing by;
\par Sloth, when souls in darkness die;
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. Chilled devotions, changed desires,
\par Quenched corruption's earlier fires:
\par Sins like these my  heart deceive,
\par Thee, who only know'st them, grieve.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 7\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 7. O how lightly have I slept
\par With Thy daily wrongs unwept,
\par Sought Thy daily wrongs unwept,
\par Shunned the wounded Comforter:
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 8\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 8. Woke to holy labours fresh
\par With the plague-spot in my flesh;
\par Angel seemed to human sight,
\par Stood a leper in Thy light.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 9\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 9. Still Thy comforts do not fail,
\par Still Thy healing aids avail ;
\par Patient inmate of my breast,
\par Thou art grieved, yet I am blest.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 10\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 10. O be merciful to me,
\par Now in bitterness for Thee.
\par Father, pardon through Thy Son
\par Sins against Thy Spirit done.\tab\tab 
\par                                  Amen.
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs16 
\par }

